1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,300
That's micromanaging.

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,680
Because what are you managing?

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,070
Inputs, right?

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,630
You're saying, “I want you to do these things,”

5
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:12,290
instead of managing outputs.

6
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,100
You figure it out,

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,100
but the output has got to look like this.

8
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:21,900
If you manage the inputs, they're like,

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,350
“What am I, a dog?”

10
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,660
But if you manage the output,

11
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:30,180
they say, “My boss has confidence

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:33,280
in my thinking capability.”

13
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:35,480
“What a great boss I've got.”
